    "congressionalg7391unit:207:par_000207_000041": {
      "text": "Sec. 4. And be it further enacted, That in further enforcement of the provision of the Constitution aforesaid, the courts of the United States in the States aforesaid shall have exclusive jurisdiction of all of- fenses committed by persons not of African descent upon persons of African descent; also of all offenses committed by persons of African descent; and also of all causes, suits, and demands to which any person of African descent shall be a party; and it is hereby declared that all such cases are to be treated as cases arising under the Constitution of the United States.",
